Performance optimization ensures Azure resources deliver the required level of responsiveness while using infrastructure efficiently.

Optimization activities include:

* Performance monitoring
* Query optimization
* Storage tuning
* Auto Scaling
* Load balancing
* Resource right-sizing

For example, administrators analyze application latency and optimize database queries before increasing virtual machine size.

A real-life use case is SaaS providers maintaining excellent user experience while controlling infrastructure costs.

Performance optimization improves efficiency and customer satisfaction.
